repository-code: "https://github.com/josepmiquelcambra/porcine-DMD-reference-gene-stability"
url: "https://github.com/josepmiquelcambra/porcine-DMD-reference-gene-stability"

license: MIT

abstract: >-
  R code used to reproduce reference-gene stability analyses in skeletal
  and cardiac muscle from a porcine Duchenne muscular dystrophy (DMD) model.
  The workflow includes input validation, quality-control analyses,
  visualization, BestKeeper-derived analysis, geNorm, NormFinder,
  comparative Delta Ct, a Weighted Stability Index (WSI),
  a Consensus Stability Score (CSS), and CSS-guided pairwise variation
  analysis.

keywords:
  - qPCR
  - reference genes
  - housekeeping genes
  - Duchenne muscular dystrophy
  - porcine model
  - BestKeeper
  - geNorm
  - NormFinder
  - Delta Ct
  - R
